  "legalTermsUsingTitle": "Using Matheasy",
  "legalTermsUsingBody": "Matheasy helps you learn maths through scanning, guided solutions, an AI tutor and practice. Use it for your own learning, and be respectful of others.",
  "legalTermsAccountTitle": "Your account",
  "legalTermsAccountBody": "You are responsible for activity under your account, so keep your sign-in secure. You can delete your account, and everything synced to it, from the Profile tab at any time.",
  "legalTermsBillingTitle": "Subscriptions and billing",
  "legalTermsBillingBody": "Matheasy Pro is an auto-renewing subscription billed to your app store account. The price and billing period are shown before you confirm. It renews automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours beforehand, and you can manage or cancel it any time in your app store account settings.",
  "legalTermsAiTitle": "A learning aid, not a guarantee",
  "legalTermsAiBody": "Answers are checked by substituting them back into your original problem, and Matheasy tells you when it couldn't verify one rather than showing you a confident guess. Even so, explanations are generated and won't always be perfect. Always double-check work that matters.",
